Note on third-party projects

soapbot's layering (adapter / provider / pipeline / plugin) was informed by
reading AstrBot <https://github.com/AstrBotDevs/AstrBot> (AGPL-3.0). No AstrBot
source code is included here, and none of its files were copied or adapted:
this repository was written from the architectural description, and the code,
identifiers and comments are original. The layering idea itself is not
copyrightable, but the distinction matters to anyone auditing the licence, so
it is stated here rather than left to inference.

If AstrBot code is ever vendored into this project, this notice is not enough:
that code would carry AGPL-3.0 and force this project's distribution terms to
change. See docs/architecture.md, section "Relationship to AstrBot".
